      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: This Canny here is about old URLs not working anymore. We have discord channels where we collected relevant Cannys over the years and none of those \"old\" links work anymore now. One example: https://vrchat.canny.io/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/please-add-eventtimingpostlateupdate (this was a real URL for several years).\n\nSo I don't understand why this Canny here got closed. Almost all my URLs start with `/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback` and I collected them from 2020 - 2022\n\n`/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-bugs` was a different board back then for actual bugs, while `/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback` was for feature requests.\n\nThose two boards got merged into one now, named `Udon`, but only one of the old URLs redirects to the new board, the other one is broken.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
