      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hey everyone!\n\nI’ve been looking more into the issue with old link redirects not functioning correctly.  I was able to pinpoint the problem and communicate it to the Canny website team.  They are working to address it, but it will take more time.  \n\nFor the time being, you can find your old posts by searching with the post title or switching out the board name in the url.  \n\nI’m going to leave this post open as it is actively in progress.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
