      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Back with an update!\n\nI have worked with the Canny team get old posts to redirect.  I've already tested out some of the provided links and they should be working.  Please let me know if they are working for you guys!\n\nHowever, any links pointing to the Canny subdomain https://vrchat.canny.io will not redirect to the VRChat custom domain https://feedback.vrchat.com.  This is the issue with one of the the provided problem links (the \"Please add EventTiming.PostLateUpdate\" post).  To be honest, I'm not even sure how you got a link with that domain.\n\nI have notified Canny we'd like this redirect feature, but it is not something the VRChat team can change. Please let me know if there are any other issues.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
