      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems like that all links i had on hand are working again. Thanks for that.\n\nThe redirect feature would be a nice cheery\n\n> To be honest, I'm not even sure how you got a link with that domain.\n\nI got that domain multiple times over the last years. I got it for example once from Support when feedback.vrchat.com were not working but vrchat.canny.io were working. I also saw people posting one or the othere in discords. There are at least some People who are using vrchat.canny.io.",
